# P102 on Android: long-press drag selection in text fields. Positions from swift-cross-ui-tablet36 on 2026-10-20 (dp = px / 2). The content is taller than the screen, so the replay measures the window origin at y -13, not 36: a point is the screen position in dp plus 13.
# FIELD text at y 191 ("quick" at x 90), EDITOR first line y 249 and third line y 293, CONTROL y 397.
# A hold is a sleep between mousedown and the moves: on Android mouseup takes no hold time and posts no move of its own (AndroidSynthesiser), so the drag is spelled out as moves.
# Pass (logcat [P102] lines): FIELD began with an empty range and ended with a forward range; EDITOR ended "backward"; no CONTROL line; the quick drag logs nothing new.
# P102 在 Android 上：文字欄位中的長按拖曳選取。座標取自 swift-cross-ui-tablet36(dp = px / 2)。按住是 mousedown 與移動之間的 sleep:Android 的 mouseup 不吃按住時間、也不自己移動，所以拖曳以 move 列寫出。通過條件見上方英文。
